<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Ascend EPS view raised.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Ascend EPS view raised.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- SoundView Financial said in a research note that it raised its earnings forecasts on Ascend Communications Inc to $1.00 per share in fiscal year 1996 from $0.97 and to $1.60 per share in fiscal 1997 from $1.45.</p>
<p>-- In midsession Nasdaq trade, Ascend shares rose 2-5/8 to 67.</p>
</text>
